---
/** Closing CTA band. Styling lives in `.terminal .band` (global.css). */
---

<section class="band" id="demo" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="cta-heading">Bring the whole portfolio onto one screen.</h2>
    <p>
      A 30-minute working session on your live accounts: where the spend is leaking, what the
      engine would change first, and what it is worth.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-p" href="/book-demo">Book a demo</a>
      <a class="btn btn-l" href="/pricing">Compare plans</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
